            <title>0.17.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 14:17:45 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.17.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.17.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.17.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>**Licence keys** — Settings › About › Licence › Manage…: click the box to paste your key. Keys are checked on your Mac, no account, no internet needed. Get one at rayto.app or from Ray</li>
<li>**Alpha builds expire** — an alpha stops 60 days after it was built and asks you to update; the latest version keeps everything you set up</li>
<li>**One permission flow** — Rayto explains Accessibility first, then macOS asks; the two no longer appear at the same time</li>
<li>**Reinstall no longer reports a crash** — the false &quot;quit unexpectedly&quot; box after reinstalling is gone</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
